# Resume a saved shift
@scenario office_lesson_19
@include /definitions/characters.vns
@label start
[mode dialogue standard]
[set ui.dialogueUi project]
[bg office]
[char pip global on]
[set ui.dialogueFadeMs 160]
[stage clear]
[show pip desk neutral]
pip: Imagine a player saves just before the reveal. Their choice should have the same consequence after loading.
pip: Save at the question, answer, reload, and take the other branch. Check the completion counter.
@label check
pip: Where should a story choice be stored?
> In VN state so save and rollback can restore it. -> correct
> Only in the displayed dialogue text. -> retry
@label retry
[show pip desk curious]
pip: A replay can reconstruct the story from its saved state. Give it another try.
[jump check]
@label correct
[show pip desk cheer]
pip: A replay can reconstruct the story from its saved state.
> Finish this lesson -> return_hub
> Try the lesson again -> start
@label return_hub
[if !tutorial_done_19]
[flag tutorial_done_19]
[inc tutorial_count]
[endif]
[stage clear]
[goto TutorialHub:topics_page_4]
